  _runtimeTextDescription: 'Press ''~'' to open/close console

    Type "help" for
    a list of commands

    Type "tfc" in console to enable/disable free camera

    Press
    ''E'' to interact with ladders and hatches'
  _debuggingTextDescription: 'Press ''~'' to open/close console

    Type "help"
    for a list of commands

    Type "mapgenerator.step <number of steps>" to execute
    operations

    Type "mapgenerator.stepall" to execute the remaining operations'
